---
const scans = ["Current branch", "Next release", "Full codebase"];
---

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Learn / search</p>
      <h2 id="how-heading" class="section-heading mt-6">Turn one security review into unlimited security scans</h2>
    </div>

    <figure class="mt-12 border-y border-border-strong py-8 lg:mt-16 lg:py-12" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
        <div class="hidden lg:absolute lg:left-[16%] lg:right-[16%] lg:top-20 lg:block lg:border-t lg:border-border-strong" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <article class="relative bg-background lg:bg-transparent">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary">Learn</p>
          <div class="mt-4 border border-border-strong bg-background p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Agent security review</p>
            <div class="mt-6 space-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground">
              <p class="border-l-2 border-primary pl-3">Reasons about application context</p>
              <p class="border-l-2 border-primary pl-3">Finds and validates vulnerabilities</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="relative bg-background lg:bg-transparent">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary">Enact</p>
          <div class="mt-4 border border-primary bg-background p-6 shadow-[0_16px_48px_rgba(180,34,28,0.10)]">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Formal security specifications</p>
            <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2">
              <p class="border border-border bg-code-header px-3 py-3">Taint rules</p>
              <p class="border border-border bg-code-header px-3 py-3">Dependency models</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="relative bg-background lg:bg-transparent">
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-primary">Search</p>
          <div class="mt-4 border border-border-strong bg-background p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Formal taint analysis</p>
            <div class="mt-6 divide-y divide-border border-y border-border font-mono text-[11px] leading-5">
              {scans.map((scan) => (
                <p class="flex items-center justify-between py-3 text-foreground"><span>{scan}</span><span class="text-primary">Scanned</span></p>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <figcaption class="mt-8 text-center font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground lg:mt-12">
        Agent reasoning establishes the specification. Formal taint analysis applies it repeatedly.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="mt-12 grid border-t border-border-strong md:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-16">
      <article class="border-b border-border-strong py-8 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:pr-12">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-foreground">Fast scans. Fewer false alarms. Fewer missed findings</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[52ch] font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground">CPU-based inter-procedural analysis applies explicit rules and models without repeating model inference.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="py-8 md:pl-12">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold leading-8 text-foreground">Open source, batteries included</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[52ch] font-mono text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Engine, rules, dependency models, agent skills, viewer, CLI, and CI integrations ship together.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
